OL,3,ASouth Korean police officer admits to
OL,4,Aclosing missing person cases to avoid
OL,5,Awork
OL,6,
OL,7,FA South Korean police officer has
OL,8,Fadmitted to closing missing persons
OL,9,Fcases without investigating them in
OL,10,Forder to avoid additional work,
OL,11,Faccording to authorities.
OL,13,FThe officer, surnamed Bu, was arrested
OL,14,Fearlier this month after he was accused
OL,15,Fof prematurely closing cases on the
OL,16,Fpopular holiday island Jeju and lying
OL,17,Fto missing persons' families.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,317,300,200,140,0,100
