OL,3,ASouth Korean police officer admits to
OL,4,Aclosing missing person cases to avoid
OL,5,Awork
OL,6,
OL,7,FAmid mounting public criticism, police
OL,8,Fembarked on belated searches for
OL,9,Fseveral missing persons on the island,
OL,10,Fand have since discovered four bodies
OL,11,Fin recent weeks.
OL,13,FThe scandal has prompted President Lee
OL,14,FJae Myung to vow to reform the police,
OL,15,Fas the government prepares to give the
OL,16,Fpolice more powers.
